    "answer": {
      "short": "$a=\\$6000,\\quad b=\\$21\\,000$.",
      "worked": "Each base tax includes the tax from all previous brackets.\n$$\\begin{align*}a &= 0 + 0.20\\times(50\\,000-20\\,000)\\\\a &= \\$6000\\\\b &= 6000 + 0.30\\times(100\\,000-50\\,000)\\\\b &= \\$21\\,000\\end{align*}$$",
